          <attvalue for="35" value="Targeted retaliatory measures (e.g., selective export controls, expedited customs inspections) applied as part of the bilateral spat can be used to slow or block specific cargo flows—including military consignments transiting the US–Canada border—reducing delivered volumes to the theater." />
