          <attvalue for="28" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="34" value="0.7" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Repeated cross‑border delays and higher transaction costs increase project execution risk and expected returns for AI infrastructure, prompting financiers and corporates to delay or withdraw planned capital allocations into the contested ecosystem." />
