          <attvalue for="34" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="A rise in long-term sovereign yields raises the cost of borrowing and refinancing for allied governments and defence contractors, prompting near-term budgetary tightening and delayed or reduced external materiel deliveries." />
