          <attvalue for="34" value="0.8" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Tighter and more frequent export‑control enforcement (licenses, audits, penalties) raises legal/operational risk for multinational suppliers and banks, causing them to stop or curtail transactions that could re‑route sanctioned goods to Iran and thus increase compliance." />
